    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to see how it can be used \"responsibly\" though, right? like even with rules, the tech is known to be super biased against certain groups and once the infra is there, it's basically impossible to go back. don't you think the risks to democracy actually outweigh the security gains in most cases?",
